sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Mech as Mechanic
    participant Shell as MechanicShell
    participant Repo as Repo
    participant Inv as InvoiceScreen
    participant Rep as ReportEditScreen

    Mech->>Shell: open Jobs tab
    Shell->>Repo: jobsWithStatus(statuses)
    Repo-->>Shell: List of JobRequest
    Mech->>Shell: Accept
    Shell->>Repo: acceptJob(job)
    Mech->>Shell: Start work
    Shell->>Repo: startJob(job)
    Mech->>Shell: _addJobPhoto(repo, job)
    Shell->>Repo: addJobPhoto(job, path)
    Mech->>Shell: Mark as done
    Shell->>Repo: finishJob(job)
    Mech->>Inv: open InvoiceScreen(job)
    Inv->>Repo: saveInvoice(job, labour, parts)
    Inv->>Repo: setJobPaid(job, true)
    Mech->>Rep: Write report
    Rep->>Repo: addReport(report)
    Mech->>Rep: Edit report later
    Rep->>Repo: updateReport(old, updated)
